SUMMARY:Migration in Changing Climates — A PLAYA + PRAx + Spring Creek P
 roject Fellowship
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T000000
UID:1ee2ee0b75aa398a295f4a5919afa5b0@sej.org
DESCRIPTION:Eight fellows from a variety of disciplines (including visual 
 art\, writing\, philosophy\, ethics\, performing arts\, sound and multidis
 ciplinary genres) will each complete a project that engages with the vital
  topic of migration — of birds\, mammals\, plants and/or people — acro
 ss landscapes undergoing rapid change in the Pacific Northwest and Great B
 asin.\n\nCategories: National (U.S.)\, Workshops and Fellowships\, Biodive
 rsity\, Climate Change\, Environmental Studies\, Journalism & Media\, Wild
 life
URL:https://www.sej.org/calendar/deadline-migration-changing-climates-play
 a-prax-spring-creek-project-fellowship
X-SOURCE:Society of Environmental Journalists
END:VEVENT
