  18\, 2026•07:00 PM</span></h4><h4>Location: <span style="font-weight: 
 normal\;">Brooklyn Public Library Williamsburg • 240 Division Ave.\, a
 t Marcy Ave\, New York\, NY 11211 US</span><br><br>Zohran Mamdani’s elec
 tion as mayor proved that New Yorkers can work together and win against im
 possible odds. <span style="font-weight: normal\;">He successfully campai
 gned on a message of an affordable city that workers in New York deserve. 
 To realize that vision\, we’ve got to keep organizing not just with ou
 r neighbors but also in our workplaces.</span><br><br><a href="https://wor
 kerorganizing.org/training/nyc/#form"><u><u>We can win together. Sign up t
 oday.</u></u></a></h4><h4><br><p><span style="font-weight: normal\;">EWOC 
 will help you build the skills and give you the resources you and your co-
 workers need to demand what you deserve.</span></p><p><span style="font-we
 ight: normal\;">RSVP for our “Unite &amp\; Win at Work” training below
 . Food service workers\, warehouse workers\, office workers\, public-sect
 or workers\, and anyone with a job is welcome (except your boss).</span></
 p><p><span style="font-weight: normal\;">An affordable New York means lowe
 r costs and more money in your wallet\, and it starts with talking with yo
 ur co-workers.</span></p></h4>
