DESCRIPTION:Join SPJ Georgia for a virtual nuts and bolts discussion about the world of independent\, audience-driven publishing -- what it is\, how to get started and how to keep it going and growing.

Panelists:
Michele Hornish\, communications professional and author of the Substack newsletter 'Small Deeds Done'
Martin Kuz\, independent journalist and author of the Substack newsletter 'Reporting on Ukraine'
Liz Kelly Nelson\, co-founder of Project C\, a home for journalists navigating the independent journalism creator economy

Moderator: Patty Rasmussen\, independent journalist and SPJ GA Freelance Chair

The workshop is free for SPJ members. $10 for non-members. 
