DESCRIPTION:AI is reshaping how newsrooms work -- and your audience is paying attention. Join Indiegraf for a live\, interactive webinar led by Laura E. Davis and Lynn Walsh from Trusting News\, where we'll help you build an AI policy that works for your newsroom\, whether you use AI tools or not. Walk away with practical templates\, real examples\, and a clear path to publishing a policy that builds audience trust.
