BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sjn": "https://us06web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_4SaxZ4q-QR20Ol9EtRzhjw"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sjn
SUMMARY:Monthly Introduction to Solutions Journalism Webinar: July
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260707T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260707T000000
UID:3758a6a6f095d86bed5e4fb93f6fdca5@solutionsjournalism.org
DESCRIPTION:Online (Zoom)\nThis one-hour Solutions Journalism Network webi
 nar will explore the principles and pillars of solutions journalism. We wi
 ll discuss its importance\, outline key steps for reporting a solutions st
 ory\, and share tips and resources for journalists investigating responses
  to social problems. We will also introduce additional resources\, such as
  the Solutions Story Tracker\, a database with over 17\,000 stories tagged
  by beat\, publication\, author\, location and more\, along with a virtual
  heat map highlighting successful efforts worldwide.\nThe training is free
  and open to all. It will be hosted by SJN's Communities of Practice Progr
 am Manager Wilson Liévano and Javier Silas Omagor of New Vision.
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
URL:https://us06web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_4SaxZ4q-QR20Ol9EtRzhjw
X-SOURCE:Solutions Journalism Network
END:VEVENT
